	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010050e"},
		line=1421,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I suddenly awaken.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"It's just before two in the morning, about an hour since I fell asleep.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"It's not a time I'd ever wake up naturally.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"My indescribable unease hadn't gone away the entire evening.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I grab my sidearm and scramble to my feet.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"As though compelled by an unseen force, I head straight for Akari's room.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I turn the handle of the door.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"...It's not locked.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"I burst into the room without hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Akari is nowhere to be seen.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The only sight that greets me is a methodically folded futon.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Akari won't be coming back.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"My intuitions as a warrior, as my lord's faithful hound, immediately know this to be true.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"There are two neatly-folded letters on the table.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"One is addressed “To Everyone,” and the other “To Tokita-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I tear open the letter meant for me.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'I ask your forgiveness for disappearing from your life with only this letter left behind.'”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'Truth be told, I did not possess the courage to tell you this face-to-face.'”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'From the bottom of my heart, I thank you for having taken me as your lord.'”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'You are henceforth liberated from your service. Our relationship as lord and servant ends here.'”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'That I might preserve some remainder of dignity, I shall omit the sordid details.'”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'All that I wish is to make eminently clear that you are not at fault in the slightest.'”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'Please understand that all this has come to pass owing entirely to my own lack of maturity.'”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'The time I spent with you truly made my heart soar.'”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'For as long as I live, I won't forget the sight of your back as you protected me during the war, nor the joy of finally having you at my side.'”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'I can only lament that I was unable to answer your fealty in kind.'”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've been dismissed...”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I picture the sorrow on Akari's face as she penned this letter.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"She hasn't been her usual, confident self ever since she was kidnapped.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"She claimed that all she saw was an illusion, but that experience must still have left deep scars on her heart.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Could the painful realization of her unworthiness as a lord have compelled her to return to Iseya?",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"No, I cannot imagine that Akari would give up so easily without a fight.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"She was, after all, someone who lived believing that it was the duty of the Imperial Family to lay down their own lives.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"She'll definitely make a move of some sort.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Odds are, it'll be at the ceremony later today.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"She will surely try to stop the announcement of Empress\nHisui's engagement.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"I have no time to waste in finding her!",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"I search everywhere I can think of, but I fail to find Akari.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"She wasn't even at the Imperial Tomb, the place I was the most sure about.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Hotori and Kotone are helping with the search, but their efforts haven't turned up anything, either.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"The sight of the cityscape from the rooftops is rife with floodlights and the illumination of military vehicles.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The Army is on high alert for today's ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Whenever I hear gunshots ringing out somewhere, I picture Akari's face stained with blood.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I have to find her.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"I attempt another prayer which ends in vain.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"The mirror before me shows no sign of change.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"When Akari-sama was abducted, I was at the very least able to divine a clue of her whereabouts.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"My concentration slips and I pitch forward in exhaustion, barely managing to catch myself with my hands.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Droplets of sweat continue to drip onto the floor.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am so sorry, Akari-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I curse my own powerlessness.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"I truly am unworthy in comparison to my predecessor.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"The Exalt-Priestess must stand above all others as a paragon of the priesthood.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shan't give up so easily.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Just one more time...",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"No, I shall persist in my search until I pass out.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Whatever I lack in power, I will make up tenfold in determination!",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I fly across the city and gather all the information I can, but still, Miyaguni is nowhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"With the urgency of a debt collector, Soujin calls me again and again.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"His voice is terribly emotional each time, and every time I hear it, it stabs me in the heart.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(If I were to disappear, would Soujin get this desperate?)”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"What a foolish sentiment.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Yet still, this sentiment becomes a red-hot serpent that slithers all throughout my body.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Unsightly... How unsightly...",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"How unsightly of any warrior, let alone a female warrior, to think such wretched thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I slam my forehead against the wall.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"The pain will cleanse my tainted heart.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"With that singular thought, I slam my forehead over and over again.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“You've done nothing wrong, my dear.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"A woman's voice enters my ears accompanied by an intense, ringing pain.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"It's a voice like lingering snow that refuses to melt even with the coming of spring.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"It comes from, of all places, my hip...",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"It is one of the spellblades we recently recovered from the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"When did I equip it? I have no idea...",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wh-What... is this?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I reach out to grab at its sheath.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"But I can't put any strength into my arms, numb down to the very marrow of their bones.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“It is not you who is unsightly.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“The only one who is unsightly... is that woman.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“That woman who stole away the man you hold most dear.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That... woman...”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Go forth, dear. Go forth and find the one whom you must revile.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"The morning sun peeks out from beyond the thick, snow-filled clouds.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Once the clouds clear up during the day, Tenkyo as seen from here will surely shine with a dazzling white.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"However, there is no snow piled up at the venue of the ceremony, with workers having toiled through the night to clear it.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"A small blessing; I won't have to carefully watch my step.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"My plan is simple. When Empress Hisui takes the podium to give her speech, all I need to do is rush Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"It goes without saying that security will be as tight as it gets.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"But as long as I'm prepared to die, it won't be impossible for me to take him with me.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"No... It doesn't even matter at this point whether I succeed or not.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"It doesn't even matter anymore...",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Biting my lip, I stare at the snow-covered roof of the Imperial Palace in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Okay, time to finish up my prayers before Soujin finds me.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"I'm sure that he's looking for me at this very minute.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"It's the reason I've been hiding up until now.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"...I don't want him to find me.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"...But I want him to look for me.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Try as I might, I can't put a stop to these sentimental feelings still lingering in my heart.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"And for this reason, I could never be fit to be Empress.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Even now, even when I'm prepared to die, I cannot give up my feelings for him.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How pathetic of me...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"I kneel before Mother's grave.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"My body tenses up at the chill of the snow.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I offer my deepest apologies for breaking the pledge I made before you in just a handful of days.)”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I am a craven who chose the life of a loved one over my pledge to restore the Empire.)”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Truly, I am unfit to serve as the lord of this land.)”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(By all rights, I should offer my own life here and now.)”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(But as one who inherited the blood of the Imperial Family, I would strike back at our sworn enemy with my dying breath.)”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I shall expose Empress Hisui and Okonogi before the people and strike them down!)”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Even should I fail in my task, those with nobility in their hearts shall surely rise up and usher in a new age.)”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I offer my undyingly sincere apologies for failing to restore the Empire with my own two hands.)”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your unworthy daughter humbly begs your forgiveness.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"I bow as deeply as I can, laying my head onto the piled-up snow.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The chill of the snow only hardens my steel-firm resolve.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"─An Empress who fails to safeguard the realm must atone with her life.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"But if I am to die regardless, surely it can wait until I've struck back at Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"As the last survivor of the Imperial Family, I shall not bring disgrace to my ancestors when I─",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“?!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"The frigid air is rent apart in the very same instant as I leap to the side.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I brace myself as I roll across the snow.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Y-You're...!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"The person who slashed at me slowly turns my way.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Wordlessly, Inou aims her blade between my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"The malefic aura radiating from her makes my hair stand on end.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"This is not the same Inou I know.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wait! What are you─!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Inou moves before I can finish my sentence.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"I reflexively dodge backwards.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"I dodged it...",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"But before I even finish that thought, her second strike is already closing in on my neck.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Cleaved in two.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"The giant stone pillar that stood where I was a second ago is cleaved in two.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Leaping to the side without thinking was the only thing that saved my life.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Inou's movements are too fast for my eyes to follow, and I can only rely on my instincts.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Compelled by the fear of death, I instinctively draw my own blade.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Its spellforce flows in through my palms and courses through me.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"A sense of lightness fills me, and it is as though my body is no longer my own.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"The spellblad",
{"ruby", text="Evening Moon"},
"e Yoizuki. ",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"A keenblade forged with only combat in mind, it enhances the strength and agility of its wielder.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
{"font", color="0xcdc0e9"},
"“Why must you steal Soujin from me?”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Her voice is cold as ice, devoid of any warmth.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
{"font", color="0xcdc0e9"},
"“If it weren't for you, Soujin would...”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
{"font", color="0xcdc0e9"},
"“Unforgivable.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
{"font", color="0xcdc0e9"},
"“Unforgivable!”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Inou dashes forward, leaving a trail of pure white in her wake.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Her blade closes in like a raging tempest, capable of tearing apart even the glittering flakes of snow in the air.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"It takes everything I have to block just a single strike.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"But Inou presses her attack with a dauntless ferocity.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The disparity in our abilities is night-and-day, and Yoizuki comes nowhere close to making up the difference.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Her whirlwind assault pierces my helpless defenses and cuts me to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"My body creaks and threatens to come apart with every blow I receive.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kh!”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"A spray of blood obscures my vision.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Kh... aah!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"A mighty body blow sends me helplessly tumbling through the air.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"I barely register the impact through the dim haze of my consciousness.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"I crash into a row of stone pillars.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaaaahhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"A dull sound rings through my ears.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"My left arm is crushed beneath a pillar.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"I-I'm okay...",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"It's just an arm...",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"I just need to get it free...",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"But in that moment, a terrible chill runs up my spine.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"When I look up, I find Inou with the tip of her blade pointed straight at me.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aah...”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Its cold steel is aimed right for my heart.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"My life will be over by the time I can reopen my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I'm so sorry, Soujin...)”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I really am useless after all.)”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"With an expression like she's crushing an insect, Inou lowers her blade towards me.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“It's not a good idea to close your eyes in the middle of battle.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Suddenly, a warm voice fills my ears.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"It's a voice that sets my heart at ease, a voice that I would surrender my entire being to.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sou... jin?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"I open my eyes as though waking from a dream.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Before me, I see Soujin blocking Inou's blade with his own body.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Unable to fully arrest her blade's momentum, its edge is biting deep into his shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"His blood slowly drips down, forming blossoms of crimson in the fresh snow.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry I'm late.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"I'm so happy that he came to save me.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"I want nothing more than to run up and embrace him.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"But I mustn't forget that I'm the one that dismissed him from my service.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oooooaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"With a mighty swing, Soujin knocks Inou aside.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Inou nimbly distances herself and lands about ten meters away.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why did you come?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You have no reason to serve me anymore!”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't care.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"As though that was the end of the matter, Soujin turns to face Inou.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, what is the meaning of this?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Inou readies her blade in lieu of a reply.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's no use. You can't get through to her.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see. It's as I feared.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Hotori I knew would never fail to name herself at a time like this.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's carried the name of her house on her shoulders since the day she was born.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Despite remaining on his guard, Soujin's words overflow with his unconditional trust for Inou.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"He says he's lost his memories, but all the time they've spent together still lives on between them.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Gripped by frustration, I pull my broken arm out from under the pillar.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have at you!”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Sparks fly.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"A distance of ten meters is but a single step for a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Their blades clash at divine speeds.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Inou's blade was an indomitable avalanche when I faced her. But now, compared to Soujin's, it's as supple as a whip.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"She has such complete control over her movements that her bladesmanship seems completely weightless.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"By contrast, Soujin's sturdy bladework is simple yet strong.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"He soundly staves off each of Inou's attacks with the least amount of movement necessary.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"From what I've heard, the two of them used to clash often, being from the same dojo.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"They are truly a worthy match for each other.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Inou's blade nicks Soujin on his flank.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Because they are so evenly matched, the wound on his shoulder proves a decisive hindrance.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"The longer their fight goes on, the more this small imbalance will tip the scales.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haah, haah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Hotori's blade shows no signs of slowing down.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"She presses her attack like a vengeful spirit, utterly indifferent to her own injuries.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"It's completely unlike how Hotori normally fights.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"The person in front of me is not ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"her.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"Is this what Kotone was talking about?",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Kotone was the one who finally gave me a clue as to Akari's whereabouts.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"While she used her magicks to search for Akari, she detected another powerful source of spellforce.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Tracing its vestiges, I found myself once again at the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, open your eyes!”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"In lieu of a reply, Hotori lunges forward.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"An overhead slash like a bolt of lightning.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"I barely manage to parry it, but the impact buries my feet into the ground, loosened by the snow.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"She seeks to crush me with the force of her blade alone.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"A brute force tactic that I could never imagine Hotori normally employing.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
{"font", color="0xcdc0e9"},
"“...",
{"ruby", text="First Frost"},
"Hatsushimo",
{"/ruby"},
"...”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"With her murmur, Hotori's blade erupts with the frigid air of the northern reaches.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"We are close enough to feel each other's breaths, and this attack that would normally have a limited effective range manages to engulf me entirely.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gh...”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"My hands gripping my blade freeze over.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Uooooaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"With all my might, I fling Hotori away before she can crush me.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"This was exactly the opening she was waiting for.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Now at the perfect distance, she swings in with all her might.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"As I receive her attack, my blade is sundered in two.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"I tumble backwards as quickly as I can.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"But still, a trail of fresh blood is left in my wake.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"An intense, burning pain runs through my body.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gh...”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"A vivid cut runs down my shoulder to my stomach.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"The gouts of blood spurting from it stain my whole body red.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A blade that controls frost?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"It's likely a keenblade.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"My inscriptionless spellblade is absolutely no match for it.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"It's a miracle that it even managed to hold up as long as it did.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, that's enough!”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Akari rushes over to my side.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You have no obligation to protect me anymore!”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Perfect timing! Akari, give me your blade!”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"I snatch her blade away without taking no for an answer.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"I know what I must do.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"There is no other option but to fight.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"I force my frozen hands around the hilt of the blade.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"My body feels somewhat lighter, likely from the blade's enchantments, but it is not enough to stop my bleeding.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Before my strength runs out...",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"I have to stop Hotori!",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Raaaaaargh!”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"She deftly turns away my strike.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"And with it, she pays me back ten, twenty-fold.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"It takes everything I have to fend off her withering onslaught of attacks.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"The fresh blood spurting from my chest spatters on the snow.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Considering how much I've bled out, I don't have much time left.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
{"font", color="0xcdc0e9"},
"“Ghh!”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"I seize a slight opening and slice her flank.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"But it's a shallow cut.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"Showing no concern about protecting her wound, Hotori's assault only increases in ferocity.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"Completely ignoring the limits of her body, she wields her blade with a supernatural speed.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
{"font", color="0xcdc0e9"},
"“Hatsushimo.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"A deluge of frost engulfs me.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"My right eye freezes over, and I lose all sense of depth in my vision.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"Under regular conditions, we would be perfectly matched.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"But with my heavy wounds, I'm at an overwhelming─",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"A part of me tumbles onto the snow.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"It was my left hand until moments ago.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"The frostbite has taken away even my sense of pain.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"A blessing in disguise; the pain won't dull my movements anymore.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"I warm my remaining frozen hand with blood and grip my blade even tighter.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Stay back!”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"Hotori is not one to hold back when I'm wide open.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"All I see is a blinding whiteness as she surges forward to deliver her coup de grace.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"Her slash is deceptively light.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"The excessive strength I put into my guard to receive her strike slows my reaction to her follow-up.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"...Gah?!",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"Her kick catches my flank like a solid lump of iron.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"I'm knocked all the way back to land at Akari's feet.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nngh, *cough...* *cough, cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"My ribs scream in protest with every breath I take.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Out of the remaining half of my field of view, I see Akari's face, on the verge of tears.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's enough, Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"Petals of Persica dance all around me.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"These things again...",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"But right now, I can't afford to let their beauty divide my attention.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"I manage to stand up by leaning on my blade for support.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am determined... to protect you!”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I told you, you have no reason to serve me anymore!”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's not true.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"No amount of reasoning can defy my will.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"My determination has no basis in logic.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"I was nothing but the empty dregs of a warrior until Akari granted me a soul.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"When the fates brought us together in Tenkyo and I protected her from the enemy's bullets, I irrevocably understood the joys of fighting in that moment.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"I've finally found that which I must protect.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"For a warrior born with no higher calling, this is our one absolute truth.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"Petty concepts like logic or the other's consent have no hold here.",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, I'm right here! My life is the one you're after, isn't it!?”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"Akari steps out in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, do it now!”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Get back!”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, you can't! At this rate, you'll─”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't care.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" protect you!”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"Akari's heartrending scream sets my heart ablaze.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"How blessed I am to be a warrior, that she would care for me so...",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"I am completely free of any remaining doubt or hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You are the greatest lord there ever was.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if you're left all alone, never stop walking your path!”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“?!”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"I face down Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"Without any hesitation. Without any fear.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"How could there possibly be?",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"To the very end, I will protect that which I must.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"Is this an illusion?",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			{
"The sight of Soujin's back overlaps with a scene I'll never forget from during the war.",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			{
"This scene of him facing the enemy, all alone.",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"No... not just from during the war.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			{
"I feel like this is a sight I've seen countless times.",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			{
"Am I imagining things?",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			{
"No...",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"My body knows.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(And yet, why can't I...)”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"Why can't I send him off with a smile?",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			{
"Why must I hold him back with my pathetic sentiments?",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			{
"It's not because I want to protect him.",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			{
"I simply can't bear to see him get hurt.",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			{
"I simply can't bear the pain of seeing him suffer.",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"It's a selfish desire to protect myself, nothing more...",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			{
"I'm weak.",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"All too weak.",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"As a helpless child, I can't help but cry out for fear of losing that which I hold most dear.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We need a lord who will stand with us to the very end.”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Otherwise, the souls of all the warriors who have fallen will surely lose their way.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We warriors put our very lives on the line to fight for our\nlord's sake.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if the enemy of our lord were a bosom friend or a cherished lover, we would not hesitate to cut them down.”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And so, it is unpardonable that our lords should waver in their resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Know that so long as you proceed with an iron will, I shall bear no grudge no matter where, no matter when I am killed or forsaken!”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ours is but to do and die, but lords have a duty all their own.”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			{
"In this moment, I finally understand the meaning of\nSoujin's words.",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			{
"Once a lord has sent her subjects unto battle, she has a duty to see everything through to its conclusion.",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			{
"No matter how painful, she must not allow her spirit to break first.",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			{
"No matter the circumstances, she must not allow herself to die first.",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			{
"She must overcome her own weakness and see things through to the very end.",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			{
"Such is the duty of a lord.",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(The resolve of the warriors... I have to accept it.)”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			{
"I have to be brave.",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			{
"I have to not fear getting hurt.",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			{
"Whatever the fates have in store for him, I have to accept it.",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			{
"I look at Soujin once again.",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			{
"His left arm is missing from the wrist down. His right is ravaged by frostbite.",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			{
"His bleeding hasn't stopped, spilling droplets of vivid crimson onto the fresh snow.",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			{
"Yet he still continues to fight.",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			{
"...In which case, I have to do that which only I can.",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			{
"A voice rings out from behind me.",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"It doesn't matter.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			{
"All I have to do is fight.",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Face your lord!”",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			{
"The most primal of instincts compels me.",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			{
"My body involuntarily turns itself around.",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"The sight of Akari fills my eyes and steals my breath away.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			{
"Her eyes spill over with a scouring light, and her aura overflows with a regal dignity.",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			{
"Even the broken arm at her side articulates her indomitable will.",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			{
"This is not the Akari of before.",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			{
"No, this is no longer the girl known as Miyaguni Akari.",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			{
"The presence standing before me is an existence that by divine right ought to stand atop the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin, heed my will!”",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Win this battle in my name!”",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I shall not abide any outcome but victory!”",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			{
"Her clarion voice echoes through the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			{
"But it is no mere voice.",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			{
"For me, it is an unmistakable invocation.",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			{
"A command of absolute authority capable of invigorating this body of mine, even on the brink of its limits.",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your will be done.”",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			{
"The edge of my soul grows keen.",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			{
"The force surging up from the depths of my body becomes a torrid flame that races through my entire being.",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			{
"Now, in this moment, I understand clearly.",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			{
"She is my sovereign─",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			{
"The one I must offer my very life to protect.",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Prepare yourself, enemy of my lord!”",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			{
"I grip my blade tightly with ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"both of my",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"hands.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[403]={
			{
"My enemy stands right before me.",
			},
		},
		[404]={
			{
"Inou Hotori, head of House Inou.",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			{
"I have no need of cheap tricks.",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			{
"I will close the distance, and with a single blow, I will─",
			},
		},
		[407]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Strike her down!”",
			},
		},
		[408]={
			{
"The way to victory is plain and simple.",
			},
		},
		[409]={
			{
"Move swifter than my enemy.",
			},
		},
		[410]={
			{
"Strike stronger than my enemy.",
			},
		},
		[411]={
			{
"Be more resolved than my enemy, and my blade shall land true.",
			},
		},
		[412]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
{"font", color="0xcdc0e9"},
"“Ghh!”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[413]={
			{
"I sunder the blade that meets mine at its base.",
			},
		},
		[414]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Forgive me!”",
			},
		},
		[415]={
			{
"I follow through with my strike, aiming directly at her neck.",
			},
